{"id":"vod_hh_71991","vodId":"71991","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"魔法禁书目录","name_cn":"魔法禁书目录","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第24集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/9cf975211038e5cb99138c2dec5786fb.jpg"},"summary":"自己的阳台栏杆上出现了像被单一样挂在上面的少女，这种非现实的情节出现在了上条当麻的眼前。虽然在这个城市——最先进科学引导的学院都市中，超能力已经可以通过科学技术创造出来，但是眼前这位自称“茵蒂克丝”的少女还是把上条当麻吓了一条。茵蒂克丝自称因拥有十万三千本魔导书而被魔法师追杀，而上条当麻靠自己的超能力也认定了少女的魔法。少女以危险为由离开上条家，上条如往日一般去学校学习，但放学回家，却发现茵蒂克丝倒在血泊之中。在科学与魔术交叉的世界中，上条当麻与茵蒂克丝的故事开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-12-19 16:00:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGNk6Lb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejWwRva/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXBG65b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejWwRPa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepWDYpd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyW4wPa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepWDYVd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyW4PEa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOpv7Yb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerWGR4a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerWGRKa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQrxnLb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw6NKRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGNkR8b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAELNPa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejWwZla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelWy5rd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https: